      "question": "How does this medicine work?",
      "seconds": 6.1,
      "response": {
        "answer": "Evolocumab blocks a protein called PCSK9 from attaching to LDL receptors. This leaves more receptors available to remove LDL cholesterol from the blood, lowering LDL cholesterol levels. [1]",
